<title>JAPAN: Nankai Plywood - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nankai Plywood - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.46		vs	    6.54</p>
<p> Operating	  654    mln	  vs	  532    mln</p>
<p> Current	    721    mln	  vs	  403    mln</p>
<p> Net		  284    mln	  vs	  162    mln</p>
<p> EPS		   30.97 yen	  vs	   23.06 yen</p>
<p> Shares		9 million	  vs	   7 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Nankai Plywood Co Ltd makes Japanese-style room ceilings and floors.</p>
